WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.338 --> 00:00:04.370
-The wingman of Florida
congressman Matt Gaetz

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.071
pleaded guilty in court today

00:00:06.071 --> 00:00:08.007
and promised to cooperate
fully with prosecutors.

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:10.576
Meanwhile, Donald Trump
is threatening to abandon

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:12.111
his former lawyer,
Rudy Giuliani,

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:14.180
who is also under
criminal investigation.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.549
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:20.119
♪♪

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:22.421
Maybe it's a coincidence,
but the MAGA crowd

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.090
seems to have a lot
of criminals in it.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.792
I don't want to
make generalizations,

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:28.327
but there are more criminals
or alleged criminals

00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:30.263
in Trump's inner circle
than there are

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:33.232
and a motorcycle gang
or a Hollywood PTA meeting.

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:37.537
If anyone ever needs to assemble
an "Oceans 11" team of criminals

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:40.973
for a heist, they could make one
entirely out of Trump cronies.

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:43.009
There's Manafort.
He's our surveillance guy.

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.877
Stone, he handles explosives.

00:00:44.877 --> 00:00:46.679
And then there's Rudy --
he's in charge of arranging

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.047
our getaway to Jamaica.

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.415
"That's right.
Jamaica, Queens.

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:51.651
Holiday Inn Express
right next to the AirTrain."

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:53.119
"No, Rudy, Jamaica, the island."

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:54.954
""Okay, okay, I'll switch it,

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.323
but I can't promise
I'll get our deposit back."

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.291
Today, for example,
close friend and ally of Florida

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:01.728
Congressman Matt Gaetz
pleaded guilty in court

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.629
to six charges
and promised to cooperate

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:05.731
with federal prosecutors
as part of the plea,

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:08.267
which doesn't seem like
great news for Gaetz.

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:11.503
-Joel Greenberg,
former Florida tax official

00:01:11.503 --> 00:01:14.907
and associate of Republican
Congressman Matt Gaetz,

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:16.342
was in that courtroom.

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:17.944
According to court filings,

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:20.546
he pled guilty
to six federal charges,

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:23.016
plans to cooperate
with federal investigators.

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:25.251
A criminal case
involving Greenberg

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:28.187
has led to a sex
trafficking investigation

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:29.722
of Congressman Gaetz.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:34.193
-We know that there were
payments made for services

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:36.829
provided that we're all set up
on a website.

00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:39.398
But in the plea agreement,
it's important to note that,

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:42.067
and this is where the key is,
that the defendant agrees

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:44.304
to cooperate fully
with the United States

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:47.906
in the investigation
and prosecution of other persons

00:01:47.906 --> 00:01:51.277
and to testify,
which is another way of saying

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:52.978
that he has already
started to sing

00:01:52.978 --> 00:01:55.348
and he is telling
the prosecutors everything

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:58.651
that he can as part
of this plea agreement.

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:01.420
-Yikes. I'd say Matt Gaetz
should lay low for a while,

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.122
but no matter how low he lays,

00:02:03.122 --> 00:02:05.558
you can still see
the top of his head.

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.894
He'd make a terrible
whack-a-mole.

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:09.795
Maybe he'll start wearing
his gas mask again.

00:02:09.795 --> 00:02:13.866
"Are you Matt Gaetz?"
"Me? No, I'm, uh, Daft Punk."

00:02:13.866 --> 00:02:15.368
Obviously, this is not
good news for Gaetz.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:17.970
I mean, we already knew about
the drug-fueled sex parties

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:20.172
and the trip to the Bahamas
with his other buddy,

00:02:20.172 --> 00:02:23.009
"a Florida hand surgeon
and marijuana entrepreneur,"

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:25.077
which is one of the characters
in "Florida Clue,"

00:02:25.077 --> 00:02:28.847
along with a vaping gator
in a Margaritaville tank top.

00:02:28.847 --> 00:02:32.885
"Was it the vaping gator in the
Tampa Publix with a crossbow?"

00:02:32.885 --> 00:02:36.355
"It was. It was also
everyone else, everywhere else."

00:02:36.355 --> 00:02:39.058
We also already know
that Greenberg and Gaetz

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:41.628
are linked through suspicious
Venmo transactions.

00:03:03.982 --> 00:03:06.285
[ Sighs ]
Not a good cover, dude.

00:03:06.285 --> 00:03:07.753
Would have been less suspicious

00:03:07.753 --> 00:03:10.289
to just use a bunch
of eggplant emojis.

00:03:10.289 --> 00:03:12.258
Also, you know,
it's suspicious

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:14.761
when someone sends
tuition money on Venmo

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:17.229
because parents don't use Venmo.

00:03:17.229 --> 00:03:18.797
They're like my parents.

00:03:18.797 --> 00:03:21.534
They think Venmo
is the lost Marx brother.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:24.036
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.036 --> 00:03:25.271
It would have been
less suspicious

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:27.439
if you'd just written
"for crime stuff."

00:03:27.439 --> 00:03:29.308
Then everyone would think
it's a joke like

00:03:29.308 --> 00:03:32.345
how you Venmo your friends
to split the check after dinner,

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:34.279
but you put something funny
in the subject line

00:03:34.279 --> 00:03:36.882
like "to buy that diarrhea
medicine you asked for."

00:03:36.882 --> 00:03:38.017
Although, side note here,

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:40.820
but why do we need
friends on Venmo?

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.889
It's for financial transactions.

00:03:42.889 --> 00:03:45.258
The Wells Fargo app
doesn't have a chat room.

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:51.230
So obviously it's not good news
for Gaetz that Greenberg's

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:53.065
started to "sing,"

00:03:53.065 --> 00:03:55.268
especially since Greenberg
has been known

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:57.570
for a long time
as Gaetz's wingman.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:00.339
-The close ties between
Gaetz and Joel Greenberg

00:04:00.339 --> 00:04:03.409
detailed at length
in a "Politico" piece titled

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:05.511
"The Congressman
and His Wingman."

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:08.647
Greenberg introduced him
to a handful of young women

00:04:08.647 --> 00:04:10.683
who he met on
SeekingArrangement,

00:04:10.683 --> 00:04:13.119
a dating website that
connects attractive women

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:14.519
with so-called sugar daddies.

00:04:14.519 --> 00:04:16.455
Friends claimed Greenberg

00:04:16.455 --> 00:04:18.824
regularly trolled
the site for dates.

00:04:18.824 --> 00:04:20.593
The two shared more
than one girlfriend,

00:04:20.593 --> 00:04:22.662
according to interviews
with eight friends

00:04:22.662 --> 00:04:25.031
and associates
who know the two men.

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:27.099
Gaetz describe Greenberg
as a wingman

00:04:27.099 --> 00:04:29.902
to some acquaintances
and even promoted him

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:32.137
as a potential
congressional candidate.

00:04:32.137 --> 00:04:33.773
-It's not illegal,
but it does feel like

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:35.241
once a man hits a certain age,

00:04:35.241 --> 00:04:37.877
that he shouldn't have
or be a wingman.

00:04:37.877 --> 00:04:41.414
Fly solo, little bird, for you
have wings of your own.

00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:43.916
But on the topic of wingmen,
one could argue Rudy Giuliani

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:45.351
served the role for Trump.

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:47.586
Rudy, of course, is currently
under investigation for his ties

00:04:47.586 --> 00:04:49.989
to shady Ukrainian characters
in his effort

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:51.958
to dig up dirt on the Bidens
during the election,

00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:54.727
which could, among other things,
be considered unregistered

00:04:54.727 --> 00:04:56.429
and illegal foreign
lobbying work.

00:04:56.429 --> 00:04:59.465
It's a sign of just how serious
this investigation is.

00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:02.535
The feds raided Rudy's apartment
and office last month.

00:05:02.535 --> 00:05:04.470
And yet this morning,
"The Daily Beast"

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:07.273
reported that Trump has blown
off Rudy's pleas for help.

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:26.926
First of all, if anyone

00:05:26.926 --> 00:05:30.796
needs to be hung out to dry,
it's Rudy Giuliani.

00:05:30.796 --> 00:05:33.299
He always looks like he fell
into the city aquarium

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:35.635
and got squirted
with squid ink.

00:05:35.635 --> 00:05:37.770
Second, I'd imagine
every hour in Rudy's life

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.071
is an hour of need.

00:05:39.071 --> 00:05:41.139
The dude butt-dials reporters,
got tricked by Borat

00:05:41.139 --> 00:05:43.209
and doesn't know the difference
between up and down.

00:05:43.209 --> 00:05:45.445
-From the top to the bottom,

00:05:45.445 --> 00:05:47.780
from the middle to the side.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.848
-[ Chuckles ]

00:05:49.848 --> 00:05:51.617
Can you imagine trying
to give this guy directions?

00:05:51.617 --> 00:05:53.385
If you told him
to take the D train uptown

00:05:53.385 --> 00:05:55.020
and meet you for lunch
at the Tavern on the Green,

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:57.022
he'd end up on the Coney Island
boardwalk

00:05:57.022 --> 00:05:58.724
fighting the seagull
for a half-eaten bag

00:05:58.724 --> 00:05:59.958
of potato chips.

00:05:59.958 --> 00:06:01.794
Also, of course, Trump is
considering

00:06:01.794 --> 00:06:02.995
hanging Rudy out to dry.

00:06:02.995 --> 00:06:04.163
What did Rudy think
was going to happen?

00:06:04.163 --> 00:06:06.833
His client is famous
for not paying his bills

00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:08.367
and turning on everyone
around him.

00:06:08.367 --> 00:06:11.570
I'm shocked Trump hasn't called
in an anonymous tip to the feds.

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:13.706
"Hello. I have information
regarding criminal activity

00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:14.674
committed by Rudy Giuliani.

00:06:14.674 --> 00:06:17.743
What's my name? It's, uh...

00:06:17.743 --> 00:06:20.546
Golf...Hat...

00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:24.083
Uh, Donald Trump.
Oh, damn it.

00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:27.653
Don't stand there while I'm
trying to think of a fake name."

00:06:27.653 --> 00:06:30.056
"Dad, I'm so sorry!"

00:06:30.056 --> 00:06:31.757
[ Laughter ]

00:06:31.757 --> 00:06:33.692
Although I have to say
some of Rudy's requests

00:06:33.692 --> 00:06:35.828
for help from Trump do seem
pretty ridiculous.

00:06:35.828 --> 00:06:37.363
For example,
Rudy wants to prove that

00:06:37.363 --> 00:06:39.232
the work he was doing
was for Trump,

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:41.267
not on behalf
of any foreign entity,

00:06:41.267 --> 00:06:43.035
which Rudy believes
would therefore prove

00:06:43.035 --> 00:06:45.338
that he didn't have to register
as a foreign lobbyist.

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:46.773
According to
"The Daily Beast"...

00:06:58.884 --> 00:07:01.621
I'm sorry, Rudy, but Donald
Trump saves his strongly

00:07:01.621 --> 00:07:03.622
worded written statements
for important things

00:07:03.622 --> 00:07:05.591
like calling a horse a junkie.

00:07:05.591 --> 00:07:07.859
Besides, I'm not sure
that would work out the way

00:07:07.859 --> 00:07:08.961
Rudy thinks it would.

00:07:08.961 --> 00:07:10.029
"It couldn't be illegal.

00:07:10.029 --> 00:07:11.330
I was doing it
for Donald Trump."

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:13.766
Rudy is like a hit man
who thinks it will help his case

00:07:13.766 --> 00:07:16.202
if the guy who hired him
talks to the cops.

00:07:16.202 --> 00:07:17.370
"You guys got it all wrong.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.671
I didn't kill that guy
for no reason.

00:07:18.671 --> 00:07:20.806
I did it because he asked me to.
Can I go now?

00:07:20.806 --> 00:07:22.808
Why are you handcuffing me?
Is this a Borat?

00:07:22.808 --> 00:07:25.344
Legally, you have to tell me
if this is a Borat."

00:07:25.344 --> 00:07:27.279
And apparently even Trump
is smart enough to know

00:07:27.279 --> 00:07:28.448
that he shouldn't
just come out

00:07:28.448 --> 00:07:30.182
and say Rudy was doing
all that shady

00:07:30.182 --> 00:07:32.251
and possibly criminal work
on Trump's behalf.

00:07:49.835 --> 00:07:51.369
So Trump isn't mad

00:07:51.369 --> 00:07:54.039
that Rudy did a bunch
of potentially illegal stuff.

00:07:54.039 --> 00:07:56.875
He's mad that Rudy bungled it
by hiring morons.

00:07:56.875 --> 00:08:00.847
But, you know, when you get mad
that Rudy hired morons,

00:08:00.847 --> 00:08:05.384
just remember, you hired Rudy.
So...

00:08:05.384 --> 00:08:07.119
You may recall Rudy
was working with two guys

00:08:07.119 --> 00:08:09.422
named Lev Parnas
and Igor Fruman,

00:08:09.422 --> 00:08:11.356
AKA "The Cute One"
and "The Shy One,"

00:08:11.356 --> 00:08:13.025
who were later arrested.

00:08:13.025 --> 00:08:15.261
I'm not sure, but I'm guessing
that's who Trump

00:08:15.261 --> 00:08:16.929
was referring to,
and can you blame him?

00:08:16.929 --> 00:08:18.931
I'm not saying
these two are goons,

00:08:18.931 --> 00:08:20.866
but they do look like the guys
who hang out

00:08:20.866 --> 00:08:22.935
with Mugsy in "Looney Tunes."

00:08:22.935 --> 00:08:24.270
They met with Trump.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.871
They were photographed
with him multiple times,

00:08:25.871 --> 00:08:26.939
including at the White House.

00:08:26.939 --> 00:08:28.007
And after that
White House meeting...

00:08:38.384 --> 00:08:39.352
...Hunter...

00:08:49.027 --> 00:08:51.396
Now, if you think these guys
don't look like super spies

00:08:51.396 --> 00:08:53.031
and Trump should have
known better, remember,

00:08:53.031 --> 00:08:56.168
this is what Trump
thinks he looks like.

00:08:56.168 --> 00:08:58.971
So maybe when he saw Lev
and Igor he was like,

00:08:58.971 --> 00:09:01.107
"Wow, I feel like
I'm looking at Daniel Craig

00:09:01.107 --> 00:09:03.876
looking into a mirror because
you were both dead ringers.

00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:06.211
I'm going to call you 0014."

00:09:06.211 --> 00:09:08.214
The point is, Trump is deeply
entangled in Rudy's mess,

00:09:08.214 --> 00:09:09.982
not to mention he's got
his own legal problems,

00:09:09.982 --> 00:09:12.651
including multiple criminal
investigations of his own.

00:09:12.651 --> 00:09:14.553
One of those investigations,
which is being conducted

00:09:14.553 --> 00:09:17.957
by the Manhattan DA's office, is
apparently so advanced that...

00:09:34.039 --> 00:09:35.240
I'm guessing
the plan right now

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:37.075
is just to cut a hole
in the roof,

00:09:37.075 --> 00:09:39.612
tie a hook to his toilet
and chopper him out.

00:09:39.612 --> 00:09:41.614
It's no coincidence
that MAGA world

00:09:41.614 --> 00:09:43.816
is full of convicted
or alleged criminals.

00:09:43.816 --> 00:09:46.218
Fundamental to the movement's
worldview is the belief

00:09:46.218 --> 00:09:48.720
that they are above democracy
and above the law.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:50.055
It's the reason
these same people

00:09:50.055 --> 00:09:51.423
have been pushing
the big lie

00:09:51.423 --> 00:09:53.258
that the 2020 election
was stolen from Trump.

00:09:53.258 --> 00:09:56.529
And yet virtually the entirety
of the Republican establishment

00:09:56.529 --> 00:09:59.832
has decided to stand
in lockstep behind Trump.

00:09:59.832 --> 00:10:01.967
The entire enterprise
is corrupt...

00:10:01.967 --> 00:10:06.338
-From the top to the bottom,
from the middle to the side.

00:10:06.338 --> 00:10:08.140
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:13.645
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:10:13.645 --> 00:10:15.814
over two million meals a year
to men, women and children

00:10:15.814 --> 00:10:17.115
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:10:17.115 --> 00:10:18.951
cancer
and other serious illnesses,

00:10:18.951 --> 00:10:20.452
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:10:20.452 --> 00:10:22.655
If you're watching this online,
you can get the donate button.

00:10:22.655 --> 00:10:24.457
Stay safe, where a mask,
get vaccinated.

00:10:24.457 --> 00:10:25.257
We love you.

